### Criar conta
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ownerName": "Alice", "currency": "BRL" }

### Depósito (troque o id)
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts/{{accountId}}/deposits
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{ "amount": 10000, "description": "Salário" }

### Transferência
POST http://localhost:8080/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{ "fromAccountId": "{{accountId}}", "toAccountId": "{{otherAccountId}}", "amount": 2550 }

### Extrato
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/{{accountId}}/entries?limit=20

### Balancete
GET http://localhost:8080/audit/trial-balance
